        <!-- ======================================================
             ROW 2 — MANAJEMEN ORDER
             
             2a (y=376): Order masuk → Cek → Mulai Buat → making → Barista → Tandai Siap → ready
             2b (y=496): {User Sudah Ambil?} → Ya → Selesaikan → done → {Ada Order Lain?}
                                              → Belum → (tunggu)
             
             Decision "Ada Order Lain?" setelah done:
               Ya  → balik ke m1 (proses order berikutnya)
               Tidak → lanjut ke Laporan
             ====================================================== -->

        <!-- 2a: Alur status order -->
